### Create process definition
POST http://localhost:8080/api/process-definitions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
X-Org-Unit-Id: 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
X-Workspace-Id: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
X-User-Id: user-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workspaceId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "orgUnitId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "processKey": "claim.review",
  "name": "보험금 심사",
  "description": "보험금 청구 심사 프로세스",
  "domainCode": "CLAIMS",
  "ownerRoleCode": "PM"
}

### Analyze impact
GET http://localhost:8080/api/process-definitions/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/impact?depth=3
X-Tenant-Id: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
